  "caveats": [
    "Coefficients are 2025/26 fits with four documented 2026/27 rule patches applied. Call BonusModel.refit_from_current_season() once 2026/27 gameweeks complete.",
    "The removal of the -1 BPS for being tackled is unmodelled: no available dataset carries times-tackled.",
    "The goalkeeper save uplift assumes p(save in box)=0.75 and p(save from big chance)=0.25. The rule bounds the nominal per-save value on [2.0, 4.0].",
    "gk_save_marginal_diagnostic measures what a save was actually worth in the source season. If it sits well above GK_SAVE_NOMINAL_2526 (2.0) then FPL's own table understated the real value, and the +1.00 BPS added per save here is on top of a coefficient that was already generous.",
    "Per-fixture expected bonus is the simulated pot, not a flat 6.0: BPS is drawn as an integer and FPL's tie rules are applied, so ties pay 7, 8 or 9 at the rate they arise (2025/26 actual: mean 6.366, max 9). BONUS_POT_SANITY_LIMIT (9.0) guards the sampler; it is not a rule of the game."
